WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:02.200
Follow military orders!

00:07.800 --> 00:09.100
Archers!

00:09.200 --> 00:10.800
At my command!

00:14.800 --> 00:16.500
Fire!

00:20.800 --> 00:22.500
Fire!

00:24.500 --> 00:26.200
Run!

00:26.500 --> 00:28.500
No!

00:34.000 --> 00:36.400
Faster! Keep moving forward!

00:36.700 --> 00:39.800
Move! No retreating! Retreat and you die!

00:43.000 --> 00:45.200
Archers, ready!

00:51.800 --> 00:57.500
The Northern Expedition may one day succeed, but they will never live to see it.

00:58.000 --> 01:02.500
Blood fills the air beneath the walls. Your throat tightens; your stomach churns...

01:02.700 --> 01:05.400
...yet you remain standing upon the ramparts.

01:05.500 --> 01:10.200
You know that for the rest of your days, you will never forget this scene.

01:10.300 --> 01:15.300
When the day comes to crush the Wunu, you will repay them a hundredfold.

01:15.800 --> 01:17.500
Fire!

01:51.500 --> 01:53.400
Fire!

01:54.000 --> 02:04.500
For three consecutive days, the Wunu drove waves of refugees against the walls. The defending garrison showed not a trace of mercy. The corpses of the refugees mingled with earth and rubble, piling into a morass of flesh and blood beneath the city...
